{"4560180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alyanom", "steam_appid": 4560180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4817420], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MINDBENDING ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/38c71ace04e2c5fc6319a997cfa42845.poster.avif?t=1784574228\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/38c71ace04e2c5fc6319a997cfa42845.webm?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/38c71ace04e2c5fc6319a997cfa42845.mp4?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into unstable spaces where reality refuses to stay consistent and even the smallest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">detail can change. Memorize each room and stay alert,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">because reality won’t stay the same for long</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SELECT THE CORRECT CATAGORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/2f70e775ebdc9cdda9df34c1a626c1e7.poster.avif?t=1784574228\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/2f70e775ebdc9cdda9df34c1a626c1e7.webm?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/2f70e775ebdc9cdda9df34c1a626c1e7.mp4?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Identify anomalies and classify them correctly using your company issues scanner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose between Object, Visual Disturbance, or Entity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Classify them correctly and remember... accuracy is everything</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>4 PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/32216f92111308ae7dc793527210d08f.poster.avif?t=1784574228\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/32216f92111308ae7dc793527210d08f.webm?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/32216f92111308ae7dc793527210d08f.mp4?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Multiple perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No guarantee any of them are right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WATCH OUT FOR ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/be984cdd20317354029d94879f0a615f.poster.avif?t=1784574228\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/be984cdd20317354029d94879f0a