itors overtime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EARN COMPANY INCENTIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/98c46b06daed94d323191cbf363a8468.poster.avif?t=1784574228\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/98c46b06daed94d323191cbf363a8468.webm?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/extras/98c46b06daed94d323191cbf363a8468.mp4?t=1784574228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn incentives for your performance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">including relaxing holidays and high-quality rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Terms, conditions, and reality may vary.</p>", "short_description": "EXPLORE 6 entropic gateways ranging from a liminal swimming pool to an empty art museum with up to 4 friends. MEMORIZE before they change each loop, then CATALOG if any ANOMALIES occur. Spaces shift from horrific entities to comedic encounters, we have no idea what's in there, that's your job.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/0883aaaf83f999f2280fa1fd03539d64892cbcce/header.jpg?t=1784574228", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/f98bdc5b253bb817dd3d50f4552333a83a66bab3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784574228", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560180/f98bdc5b253bb817dd3d50f4552333a83a66bab3/capsule_